    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe Inverdi, Coomatloukane, Caherdaniel, occupying an exceptional coastal setting towards the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, The Inverdi offers a rare opportunity to acquire a home in one of South Kerry's most unspoilt locations. Set on approximately 25.59 hectares (63 acres), the property enjoys extensive frontage onto the sea together with breathtaking panoramic views across the Atlantic coastline and surrounding landscape.\n\nExtending to approximately 122 sq.m (1,313 sq.ft.), the residence offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation and sits comfortably within its spectacular surroundings. The substantial landholding provides exceptional privacy and a wonderful sense of seclusion, while the dramatic coastal scenery and natural beauty create an idyllic setting for those seeking peace, space and direct access to nature.\n\nLocated just a short drive from Caherdaniel Village, Derrynane Beach and local amenities, the property represents a unique opportunity to acquire a coastal home with an extensive landholding in an area renowned for its outstanding natural beauty.\n\nKey Features\n\nDetached residence extending to 122 sq.m (1,313 sq.ft.)\nApproximately 25.59 hectares (63 acres)\nExceptional coastal setting with extensive sea frontage\nPanoramic views across the Atlantic coastline\nLocated towards the end of a quiet cul-de-sac\nA wonderfully private setting surrounded by unspoilt natural beauty\nShort drive to Caherdaniel Village and Derrynane Beach\n\nCaherdaniel Village 6 km (4 miles)\nWaterville 14 km (9 miles)\nKenmare 47 km (29 miles)\nKillarney 80 km (50 miles)\nKerry Airport 85 km (53 miles)\nCork Airport 145 km (90 miles)"
      },
